WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.320
In temples across East Asia, people
chant four short vows together.

2
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.570
The first one says: beings are countless,

3
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.410
I vow to free them.

4
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.820
Not a few beings, and not
only friends and family.

5
00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:15.780
Every single one.

6
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:21.650
So why would anyone vow to stay in a world
of suffering until every being is free?

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.450
In this mission, you'll
meet the bodhisattva:

8
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.480
a being set on awakening,
for the sake of all beings.

9
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:33.320
Then you'll cross the six perfections, and
compare the bodhisattva with the arhat,

10
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.690
the worthy one.

11
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:40.200
Your mission: find out why anyone would
vow to stay until every being is free.
